# Loads on a floor

| Action | Symbol | Value |
|---|---|---|
| Permanent | G | 4.5 kPa |
| Imposed | Q | 3 kPa |

G: 4.5 kPa
Q: 3 kPa
span: 5 m | beam span
spacing: 2.4 m | beam spacing

## Combinations
w_uls: 1.2 * G + 1.5 * Q -> kPa | strength combination
w_sls: G + 0.7 * Q -> kPa | serviceability combination

## Line load on one beam
q_uls: w_uls * spacing -> kN/m
Mstar: q_uls * span^2 / 8 -> kN*m

Vectors and matrices use brackets: columns are separated by commas, rows by semicolons.

forces: [10, 20, 30]
K: [2, -1; -1, 2]
